    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d736">

                <pb facs="0994" n="892" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg892"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Italy/239</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Italian Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Rosso</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-12-07">December 7,
                        1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have been instructed to inform you that, referring to the contents of the
                    communication which this Embassy has addressed to the Department <pb facs="0995"
                        n="893" xml:id="pg893"/> of State on the 14th of June last, with regard to
                    the war debt, the Italian Government proposes to make on the 15th of December
                    next a further payment of one million dollars in acknowledgment of the debt
                    pending a final settlement.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rosso</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
